=You are an agency brand strategy director. Analyze this new client's intake data and website copy to create their permanent Brand Voice Profile:

Client Name: {{ $('Client Onboarding Form Trigger').first().json.body.client_name || 'Acme Corp' }}
Industry: {{ $('Client Onboarding Form Trigger').first().json.body.industry || 'Technology' }}
Target Audience: {{ $('Client Onboarding Form Trigger').first().json.body.target_audience || 'B2B Founders' }}
Goals: {{ $('Client Onboarding Form Trigger').first().json.body.goals || 'Organic Authority and Pipeline' }}
Website Raw Content:
{{ typeof $json.data === 'string' ? $json.data.slice(0, 6000) : 'Website data analyzed.' }}

Generate pure JSON containing:
1. 'brand_archetype' (e.g. The Innovator, The Trusted Guide, The Challenger)
2. 'tone_dimensions': { 'formality': (1-5), 'enthusiasm': (1-5), 'humor': (1-5), 'authority': (1-5) }
3. 'key_messaging_pillars': array of 3-4 core topics
4. 'approved_vocabulary': array of 8-12 power words/phrases to use
5. 'banned_phrases': array of clichés or off-brand phrases to avoid
6. 'system_prompt_snippet': a reusable system prompt instruction for future content generation workflows for this client

parameters.jsCode:
const item = $input.first();
const intake = $('Client Onboarding Form Trigger').first().json.body || {};
let profile = item.json.output || item.json.text || item.json;

if (typeof profile === 'string') {
  try {
    profile = JSON.parse(profile);
  } catch (e) {
    const m = profile.match(/\{[\s\S]*\}/);
    if (m) profile = JSON.parse(m[0]);
  }
}

const clientName = intake.client_name || 'Valued Client';
const clientEmail = intake.client_email || 'client@example.com';
const clientId = 'CLIENT-' + Date.now();

return [{
  json: {
    clientId,
    clientName,
    clientEmail,
    ...profile,
    status: 'ACTIVE_ONBOARDED',
    onboardedAt: new Date().toISOString()
  }
}];
